{
  "mn112:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 112 ",
  "mn112:0.2": "Chabbisodhanasutta ",
  "mn112:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn112:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn112:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn112:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn112:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn112:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn112:2.1": "“Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu aññaṁ byākaroti: ",
  "mn112:2.2": "‘khīṇā jāti, vusitaṁ brahmacariyaṁ, kataṁ karaṇīyaṁ, nāparaṁ itthattāyāti pajānāmī’ti. ",
  "mn112:3.1": "Tassa, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno bhāsitaṁ neva abhinanditabbaṁ nappaṭikkositabbaṁ. ",
  "mn112:3.2": "Anabhinanditvā appaṭikkositvā pañho pucchitabbo: ",
  "mn112:3.3": "‘cattārome, āvuso, vohārā tena bhagavatā jānatā passatā arahatā sammāsambuddhena sammadakkhātā. ",
  "mn112:3.4": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "mn112:3.5": "Diṭṭhe diṭṭhavāditā, sute sutavāditā, mute mutavāditā, viññāte viññātavāditā—",
  "mn112:3.6": "ime kho, āvuso, cattāro vohārā tena bhagavatā jānatā passatā arahatā sammāsambuddhena sammadakkhātā. ",
  "mn112:3.7": "Kathaṁ jānato panāyasmato, kathaṁ passato imesu catūsu vohāresu anupādāya āsavehi cittaṁ vimuttan’ti? ",
  "mn112:4.1": "Khīṇāsavassa, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno vusitavato katakaraṇīyassa ohitabhārassa anuppattasadatthassa parikkhīṇabhavasaṁyojanassa sammadaññ